% The body of the test-desclabel documents: description lists after
% footnotes, which a wide screen floats beside the text, checked by
% visual.mjs at 1400px: each list and label where it is without the
% footnotes, with the label next to a block that starts its item or ends
% its list. Then the text after an \hfill and a proof's QED box, also
% floats, after footnotes, and footnotes that reach below the end of the
% text. A list before any footnote, and enumitem's \newlist, are guards.
